       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRING-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "PRASANNA".
       01 LAST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "SAI".
       01 FULL-NAME PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
       01 TEXT-POINTER PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO FULL-NAME WITH POINTER TEXT-POINTER
           END-STRING.
           DISPLAY "FULL NAME: " FULL-NAME.
           DISPLAY "NEXT POSITION: " TEXT-POINTER.
           STOP RUN.
